OL,6,G2245 Driving: How Old Is Too Old?
OL,7,G     Tonight
OL,8,     FWith one in seven UK licence
OL,9,     Fholders now over 70, the number of
OL,10,     Folder drivers on our roads is
OL,11,     Fsteadily rising. Driving means
OL,12,     Ffreedom and independence, but as
OL,13,     Fwe age, our driving can change,
OL,14,     Fand Ginny Buckley reports on
OL,15,     Fwhether enough is being done to
OL,16,     Fensure older drivers are fit to be
OL,17,     Fbehind the wheel
